label: Dwelling Rating Query
description: >-
  The cokey whose "ENG - Dwellings W/O Basements" rating is wanted.

  THIS IS THE INTERESTING DEPENDENCY: its input is the output of a REDUCTION
  over the previous fetch. Effect 3 cannot be issued until effect 2's results
  have been gathered and folded. Three chained effects where each one's
  request is computed from the last one's answers.
fields:
  cokey:
    type: utf8
    label: Component Key
    description: The dominant dry component to rate
    nullable: false
    validations:
      minLength: 1
      maxLength: 30
